{%- comment -%}
  One product card for the current product, rendered only through the Section Rendering API
  (`/products/<handle>?section_id=worktop-card`). Product cards fetch it when a colour swatch is picked, to swap
  the card to that colour without a page load (assets/worktop-card-colours.js). It has no presets, so merchants
  can't add it to a page.

  `section_id` is the placeholder `SWAPUID`; the script replaces it with an ID that is unique on the page.
  Layout settings (image ratio, quote button) stay those of the card being swapped; only its content is used.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'card-product',
  card_product: product,
  media_aspect_ratio: 'adapt',
  image_shape: 'default',
  show_secondary_image: false,
  lazy_load: false,
  skip_styles: true,
  show_quote_button: true,
  section_id: 'SWAPUID'
%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.worktop_card.name",
  "tag": "div"
}
{% endschema %}
